From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:01:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): repin survives Board churn; creator worker can
 repin its queued card (#827)

* fix(kanban): worker-first repin retries a revision_conflict after a pull; a creator worker can repin its own queued card [daveey]

* refactor(kanban): keep the creator-repin tool path out of the kanban_tools facade (line cap) [daveey]
